flowchart TD
    Actors[Existing rear actor IDs] --> Query[Narrow keyed detached ledger projection]
    Person[Person owner / health / assignment / rear place / holder] --> Query
    Stock[Actual keyed held Stock: type + quantity] --> Query
    State[Session command / settlement state event] --> Coalesce[One pending membership and cargo refresh]
    Coalesce --> Query
    Query --> Visuals[One scene-owned eligible worker visual per real ID]
    Move[Existing entity_moved: committed endpoint] --> Cached[Only affected cached visual position and heading]
    Cached --> Visuals
    Human[Already imported mesh / skin / idle at 1.8 m] --> Visuals
    Role[Worker ID + actual role + actual cargo count] --> Visuals
    Manager[Separate controlled manager: You label] -. never worker roster .-> Visuals
    Replace[World replacement / exit tree] --> Disconnect[Disconnect old ledger; bind current owner]
    Disconnect --> Coalesce
    Rules[Workforce / custody / routes / clock unchanged] -. read only .-> Query
    Visible[Rear root visibility only] -. never pauses gameplay .-> Visuals
